{"unit_id":"liuhaolong16__dsh-hot-refresh#card-zh","repo":"liuhaolong16/dsh-hot-refresh","commit":"53dddde2853b1c5a8c08c6864ff3ed3d9103bb9a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hot-refresh 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的面板热刷新插件。它在设置侧栏和插件详情页注册操作入口，并由宿主路由调用 DSH 的 clientModules.rebuilt 来触发客户端模块刷新。用户可对单个插件行即时刷新、按客户端模块版本差异只刷新变化行，也可在二次确认后刷新整张插件图；健康接口提供模块图、宿主版本和客户端上报信息。适合开发或管理 DSH 客户端插件时快速应用变更。需要 DSH Web 宿主提供相应服务与 slots。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:295-318","lib/host/impl.js:37-70","lib/host/impl.js:83-130"]}
{"unit_id":"liuhaolong16__dsh-hot-refresh#card-en","repo":"liuhaolong16/dsh-hot-refresh","commit":"53dddde2853b1c5a8c08c6864ff3ed3d9103bb9a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-hot-refresh adds refresh buttons to the DSH web panel. It calls clientModules.rebuilt to reload one plugin row, rows with changed revisions, or the graph after a second confirmation. A health endpoint reports graph and host status. Requires a DSH web host with clientModules and slots.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:295-318","lib/host/impl.js:37-70","lib/host/impl.js:83-130"]}
